# Maintenance handler: only the /majadu subtree is closed. The other handlers on
# api.qouver.com (hooks, sds, skyward) keep working while the database is
# replaced, which is exactly what a maintenance window should mean.
#
# Writes get 503 + Retry-After; reads get a page instead of a proxy error.
handle /majadu/* {
	header Retry-After 120
	header Cache-Control "no-store"

	@write not method GET HEAD
	respond @write "Majadu is being updated. Please reload in a few minutes." 503

	header Content-Type "text/html; charset=utf-8"
	respond `<!doctype html><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="robots" content="noindex"><title>Majadu maintenance</title><p>Majadu is being updated. Please reload in a few minutes.</p>` 503
}
